  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-080 (Phase 4 — app: first usable build): iOS app target: Xcode 27 project in `App/` (iOS 27), local package `HFRKit` linked, simulator and device build, app build job in CI, ADR on the project-file strategy.\n\n### Scope\n\niOS app target: Xcode 27 project in `App/` (iOS 27), local package `HFRKit` linked, simulator and device build, app build job in CI, ADR on the project-file strategy\n\n- Module: App · Difficulty: medium · Priority: high\n- Audit source: ROADMAP Phase 4\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-080-app-target.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-080-app-target.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#25](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/25) — LOT-080: iOS app target (merged; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#24](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/24) — chore(lots): claim LOT-080 (iOS app target, Mac) (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#51](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/51) — Claim wave 4 (021, 022, 030, 033) and add app lots 080-083 (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#94](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/94) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: mac/w1-080-opus` (2026-10-27)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done (#25)`.\n",
